# The Vercel project is configured with `web` as its root directory.
# Keep the deployment payload limited to that application so local Xcode
# products and archived worktrees are never scanned or uploaded.
/*
!/web
!/web/**

# Never upload local dependencies, generated output, Vercel state, or secrets.
/web/node_modules
/web/.next
/web/.vercel
/web/.env*
/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
